#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Canto se ten que parecer a túa cara e se Ubuntu Hello che pide confirmar que "
"estás realmente aí."

#: src/main.ui:657
